# Wildwood Scourge: a non-Hydra creature entering with counters counts as having them put on it (ruling 2024-11-08), and the
# trigger puts one counter on Scourge however many were put (Walking Ballista with X = 2 enters with two).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Wildwood Scourge
Walking Ballista
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Wildwood Scourge.Cast(X: 1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Wildwood Scourge.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Walking Ballista.Cast(X: 2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Walking Ballista.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Wildwood Scourge.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
